<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank suspends liquidity issues.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank suspends liquidity issues.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank is suspending issues of bank liquidity paper, a spokesman said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank has resolved to suspend the placement of bank liquidity paper,&quot; he said, without giving further details or any reason for the move.</p>
<p>-- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
